  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af0335a577fd43c35d368c90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "过来吧，来这座比梦境甜美的……奇迹舞池吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cca1dec5467c23860d5b3ae51240ef52a7d92eb3a77160411a438d9a11ea0f39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac032731a5cc5a36602cd71d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "月見団子、色々アレンジしたいな。\r\n定番の兎に、犬や猫もかわいいし…\r\nうん、ヒシアマに相談してみよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f7a18d194e97e154601802519c77657861f43883cf035bd8ba9caa2446e8b1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "400083"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbd4dc6cea95c55a21bd2bda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要让现场的大家能够尽兴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb01cfeeca7a2fbc0d16224635f25415c50f9afcaf5d79823adead9196b30efe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ab33576e21cf708a944aa1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "并不是只有赛场上\r\n才能看见「奇迹」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1853c48185899904b4de83aa57c8b02dbfc117fa095d1a9d4c8bcb6a3491ded9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ea331ff434e90f045fa3407",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起向前迈进，\r\n一起在比赛中创造奇迹吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "349564ac25c768bc6c552b2735866050928149b9c7b364c2787b6b7f93129492",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a9bf62340fefc517b973e0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们是因为你掉落的\r\n训练员徽章才相遇的。\r\n呵呵，真令人怀念呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbe73bc9a3a85885a3e58c607bf0be0fb27a2557029cb38313be304d31dbc9f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c358881b1191b425b7171c12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "清爽的颜色我很喜欢哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ce890745b97a16b84bd205c709f1cee212344305245a02dce4aa61c872ebabc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08b35235659be0c28319618c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样的我，感觉怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "79f98f6fc7c9b0fb65425b7fb7dfcdc0133694b135b0068077b77a6f5b272ed4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed4a82a1ed0924d3927c3573",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你觉得如何？我的舞台装。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ccde435e5f044f3bd4c91b999e6c6729e3d46963fbf006b9ba13735d9bb0b47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c504b19c07fa0ae166c546ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然穿裤子比较自在，\r\n但这样也不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d651c4f2339a1f600adb959e819b0f6b29a7ac382e5b292c0150d616cfd95a92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08516a77b37df75781df010a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是唱歌或跳舞都不能松懈，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c642f2b4f630934c8f23d41ff21fbb0a5a6306c4185ebe358dc3261ebfccfd4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9051e35e7beec41b5190c76d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会带给各位最精彩的表演哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fbfd1e950430f6d5d257b45532fde8c027a1072a76e98fdd99e727d1d9deed6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e663847c00cb1ceb26ac5380",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "华丽，而且优雅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7930a894b6444ba05a86d69f2d9cdf017e06265d3535dcc110df344af69a8ad2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d4d7ea8f61005466eddfd26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们两人一起成为舞池的焦点吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9492a4a74a0338835e94dde248f6993fe233f681b42c9ef050da009009ccf7a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:297cac92fb90abc9ae249d1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表演要开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d10506080e1eba29e2ebfdac5d319d6671e28ee22d7c5540edc61bd87e109cd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eace692b8aa3274a71d9485c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让你看见「奇迹」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eb9871c3cf82d601a9e5ca104ff60996eca51ebd7ba72732ebc0e9dced42cc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f68630ed447b0afc8b90e383",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "エスコートしてもかまわないかい？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2441b309ae4a22deb781ffa7162854bc552262363bb4360379a40a4374e6d819",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6641520e66de7dc3de5d5a82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "袖をまくっていても、手品はできるんだよ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6e329ee9af7f8d84b14a422a855ba99d91fa86974af35c41ded688c8db366f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e69a30fa9833055fe16ca6d1",
