      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81842a22737ce0e42d6accce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让你看见「奇迹」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eb9871c3cf82d601a9e5ca104ff60996eca51ebd7ba72732ebc0e9dced42cc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b85c3e4a392dabdf6f6c93f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abe6ac64e9929f9a52b7e50a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你这次的对手是我喔。\r\n来，过来这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bd52c8755b79e01a7f4173887b80c962603f646b05ad4067f30bc5ec1ea1b6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f28b928d4fb149717701b3da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还不够。\r\n拿出真本事让我瞧瞧吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aec055b71c939e64e1d9e3fab89f44f2eeced19b587d63e7788de1e6910d9d55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73b39eec7435b4125a4e6c4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能一大早就看见大家的笑容，\r\n来想想看可以给大家什么惊喜好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cfada3108c85ca637bb6cc44621dd61554900f90929dd40854c2736bc228e1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e90a51159a4fb6f5318add5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还没吃早餐的话，要和我一起吃吗？\r\n我会让你度过连瞌睡虫\r\n都会眼睛一亮的美妙时间哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ceaa394bb610f77357ce5239c3ee22bfb4214a520f4e575c982c56b35e77792",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9917f86b179eed6a3e7da24b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在下午的训练开始前，\r\n要不要一起喝杯茶呢？\r\n能够享受日常才能有更好的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "096cc248f2d6cd2666b9868295867d9c382c8d0e6359b8963c462f4e985841e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4c0909cbc88a0db1bdf54a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "中午要不要和我一起去食堂呢？\r\n我决不会让你觉得无聊的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "418f3a7c6293d46f8c079fb2e9cbe2c42385600f57a47414ce13517d296496e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dde98616723a23bf555eeb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了该去巡视的时间了。\r\n不知道我可爱的小马驹们，\r\n有没有都乖乖的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d7983773f02688905d3bcadd0dd457f5907252c2daad62898ed341ae05f548e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bb6b1f51096648bfc423009",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果会忙到很晚的话就跟我说吧。\r\n晚上自己一个人走是很危险的，\r\n我会负责送你回房间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c2b6b3cdc327d037010b97b2a093078db8c9945bb5e5b3a08bdebce42bd268b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae3e64694ca57f6266684d3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天是相遇的季节。\r\n我要为新加入的小马驹们，\r\n带来什么惊喜好呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c2bf0c34ab65fc531f321c963efab4d3482852741fdc12da193e986cd146454",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f5754e426f1342ac9fa2bc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要小心不要因为中暑而昏倒哦。\r\n不然一不小心……\r\n就会发现自己躺在我怀里咯？哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55c936f11552c0ae2b9ad1a3bdc673b96a9bb1a28a39a8455dcdae121c768f38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8611325d4ca35e7bb9b93da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有人会扑进扫成堆的落叶里哦……\r\n呵呵，因为实在是太可爱了，\r\n所以我也没办法对她们发脾气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d09d5b889cf780cf8199c747c38c14542a1187a37d8c20795a4dd4d3e80e2c93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce37b98ef1c7dce3b0433490",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "地面结冻时很容易滑倒，\r\n为了随时可以撑住别人，\r\n我得随时保持两手有空的状态呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef5038fa696d61f4a2af8c14e4131e8b7476f3852340f4dc071a891561bac89a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bb9de23acdf8bd63028be83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要让今天成为什么样的日子呢？\r\n我想让你体验到跟这件礼服上\r\n盛开的花朵一样美妙的喜悦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e053f2a16a9b45697fdf4f41983656f884afc428be1bb8593aabf46233909ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fc76f8f1a5d6ac282cd687d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还有点困吗？\r\n不介意的话，我来跳支\r\n会让你打起精神的舞吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c52b3b9619a461db7193d32976d4ff8cee2775d192a769e62067f780ef04161a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f64beba9328aacdc1cef043d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢这件衣服华丽的地方。\r\n因为名为惊讶的鲜明色彩，\r\n能点缀你的日常生活。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7b2edb0aee3e6ad343995b9529089d011c5ace6b1f345d001130987ae3f436c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa1f77d2db6466f1f6a4a155",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果你下午有空的话，\r\n可以陪我一下吗？\r\n我想向你展示我新学会的舞步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "624c0b10a0879d54afc07a1ebfe772405fde93511aa1a8afc4588b9b326c1684",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:868cc769ef30ff6b0b5ca197",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样的夜晚适合跳\r\n步调缓慢的华尔兹呢。\r\n还是你喜欢热情的探戈？",
      "source_fingerprint": "19cde1e6447d31c24c68da4ddfc44e1d5bccc4027be213fbfafe337b2fa06325",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:442c65ed69a1cfa2b0b36228",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜晚还很长……\r\n在月光下起舞也不错呢。\r\n熄灯时间前跳一下怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "10071b5f39a4dd3ebe0e9cfc5ee11d735dbfef48e9fc580abf43398176f44edc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e476c4b4d22e4f95a3c6d498",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天同时也是离别的季节……\r\n希望盛大的典礼，\r\n能在多一点人的心里留下回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcc594a2f832e665d73fad4e55982335e199c9eda9c265a93c4a86a1761c723e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f9fb1537f61253d5eacde14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想打扮得凉快一点，\r\n应该多少能消解\r\n你的暑气……有效吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dcb9cb1da990ab123112039574673426446516cfdbb200b6fb498a47a85eb78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcb6ec05f8bef3f225c88d6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "艺术之秋……就是要跳舞！\r\n不介意的话能请你与我共舞吗？\r\n让我们像红叶般翩翩起舞吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a413c156386f0582348c8ac9079674ccdbd464552349ffea25ad0cfc663c555c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9508ebc34ca64229b9405304",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "问我会不会冷？我没事。\r\n因为你的热情已经让我的心\r\n像拉丁舞的节奏般狂热！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8e9fb866a806bab1e318f461820f8eecf8337ced0aad494b94e3f06974b8a3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10044d39374e8f5914b2c0d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:276c298009775b657427c8fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f9553191d66f9a91a007c36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "母亲在舞台上的演出……\r\n感觉比以前更有魅力了。\r\n我想是因为她从来都没放弃努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "281cd6abf7266ea7c6e90d6221a7d7c74cd07e96add8ef690cd4d1334f3c9d83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85b481d23b512294597d93ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在练习让手冒烟的魔术时，\r\n菱亚跑过来问我\r\n「你学坏了吗！？」……啊哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02b383349e6f7caed74827e60cbd723311301345c55cc55af5210fcedd0ef96a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dde2ec1d316649e268aa73bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果让白仁嘴里的叶子开花的话，\r\n就算是她也会觉得惊讶吧？\r\n我想要试试看呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c5af467a778aae006c80ec78d989a740eba9f4b9135f5984484a7ae7862eacc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:906795f624f990088997f311",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢看见人因为惊喜，\r\n表情由惊讶变成笑容的瞬间。\r\n呵呵，真的会让人欲罢不能呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1209990c4282b7e549393428e0cbf62c77cdc14d7a73a0c712a7af4b5912b7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98b5430024b91a896fdd5af2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我几乎都是带给人惊喜的，\r\n但还是时常被速子给吓到呢……\r\n嗯～我可不能输给她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a08becdcecaf2e75f985919941818922306b39efe3971d11395609dd22b73481",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f40363483dacf035a2ed3a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然比赛和舞台表演，\r\n都是表现自己的地方……\r\n但你眼里看到的我是什么样子呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f81b0ddd0d24dd8b59b059561bc97b99a074f0d38b70986038f6cd9c6b9cdda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7c99065679f8d3069bd2276",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可爱的服装也不错，\r\n和我平时的感觉不一样，\r\n所以能让大家感到惊讶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dd4c05617fa75f8d7ae480af9ecc67a03f4e307fd6e271aab433113b96fb491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ce415fb629edd031819b82d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有些人称我为「黑色流星」。\r\n这套衣服就能呈现出\r\n适合这个称号的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "122ba28f43e1b83d66524103a6439fe5752a215a22aa938a2ae4c81c99e79c57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:028c4483f5425bb3dfc065f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得，如果是和你一起，\r\n我可以无止尽地一直向前奔跑。\r\n这就像是所谓的「奇迹」吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e28b24ef11edc9296f87f7737d9a833dafeafb320d18e1db224b77bdd9e3bb69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0df13d48f3e1320ac45cf762",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很注重服装仪容。\r\n如果睡醒的时候发现头发翘起来，\r\n我就会利用它来设计造型！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7693195264a3ce14d09b287da71be4a5fd51777e752b77031981a393b11b2b50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05690387c39cea24a44b2d4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时间的食堂里，\r\n应该到处都是小马驹们吧。\r\n一定可以度过一段开心的午餐时间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ca6e142646fa9182ff068bdb394fc845bfd876ef5b6c5fcc468335854fc6e1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b44e503e4e380522be730b11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "违反门禁时间的人，\r\n就要用富士特制的惊吓箱逗笑她……\r\n呃，这样就不能算是惩罚了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2bd6ebbe65d490bef73e6591310c5392cc6c6ca12ae70512f9c8f5a12883b4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e03751c42de5339a6fe5d26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多该是菱亚会吵着说\r\n「要赏花啦──！」的时期了吧。\r\n好，我也要提前准备我的表演项目！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f28b3e19ee33d4279f6d9544e6b6bd448986119962f69297b1281a93d931a96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f737c6a04d72432a2ac9a0b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海边虽然很好玩，但毕竟也很危险，\r\n所以也必须提醒小马驹们\r\n不要忘记注意安全才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea6a0658f87da6bdf6d960daf1fb29db87dd2f90c6f618bf5ecd7f34a1f9f484",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:729395c17c8d89fbf112e260",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了这个时期后，就会有很多来商量\r\n「不小心吃太多了～」的人。\r\n呵呵，很可爱吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "675bde2c4ba74d607550978644a4e0f2d8fe6ef6238b69d571a6650bf5217147",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d24499616303b06e38f4f45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戴手套接住雪的时候，\r\n就能用肉眼看见雪结晶。\r\n像是收到了从天而降的礼物一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd2195243b8a5a84d404598dbc64c2324567fa18a76e9270ba9658f1926c26a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adb0b870a697535ecb6e95da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "菱亚惊讶地对我说\r\n「居然不是晚礼服」。\r\n呵呵，有让你觉得惊喜吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdcc9c09cb0a1923143e64805a2a30efac5331fe0931801793796102ee390133",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d77ef291589647a4ab2a9341",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家拜托我教她们跳舞，\r\n但我一勾手臂就让她们脸红……\r\n真可爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5206e6f3d3de9e791322ad74f1678dd901fee773dc8ca7044fdd427274f4742b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abb4a25a2fee6c4470b7847a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有看见天空吗？\r\n我想再跟她跳一次舞。\r\n如果遇到她请帮我转达。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6169cd9fd6f6671a25acb8e207735e2bb88da2822627f0fa2f8400d3222935f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:136898276b2e8de4afcfd373",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天狼星前辈常反过来让我\r\n感到惊讶……如果能学会她的\r\n利落和强悍，感觉会很有趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abbbc4eb147d6be5e3454728d700b07935ea178a4f6ab969eed085f45a0a8601",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4e11645da7e861d4abc5b9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "包含标准舞和拉丁舞在内，\r\n只要是社交舞我都会跳喔。\r\n你今天想看什么样的我？",
      "source_fingerprint": "24c84d27675142a2a7f6a0f8cfb113564ae567ec67a4576314080c886e916412",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08a4a26b7caee03160321eb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我自认将服装做得很完美，\r\n但毕竟上面有很多装饰……\r\n嗯～还是再确认一次好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6bed942f531c251ae481089b34c46d0106d37ee8a6d5c5a4a50d177299ad81b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b63a2c98a254ea1cb5369911",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿这种衣服时，\r\n通常只能选方便吃的餐点。\r\n我以前在剧团很常吃饭团呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4825dec8d053af84c715a9532c4e48422f08d893c135f9eee9feb65947a45e22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5476181020e9297e0190b62e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你愿意陪我共舞一曲吗？\r\n……呵呵，开玩笑的！吓到你了吗？\r\n这样能给人完全不同的感觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f32ee0b4914824ce08f5aa6c32a9e174a904aafbc714c4581839030e2c182200",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d66bbb018f47f3525aae77d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直道舞会的季节到了！\r\n在因春风而华丽起来的舞厅中，\r\n不管是谁肯定都能成为主角。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cfe2a27d147a2ff39464e4b5f4266d093cb386b625fdee5e7cb4fa642866ef0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b420c9acaff70f49e1a0ccf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到适合夏天的舞蹈，\r\n就会想到激情的桑巴或捷舞……\r\n但现在跳太热了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f519d57cdd20aac3011a9ae2f41a5b25a3fc21bd9efc4471e315e4c1e0a3ec2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2af98e46186c6921e9243353",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在秋天的长夜鉴赏音乐怎么样？\r\n偶尔听一下古典乐，\r\n也很有气氛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ace0dd2b29974f04ea4ba46cdfc9574a7d1ef3970fee114e00d764234e24d68e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "91026"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
